# .claude/task-flow.md  (copy to your repo's .claude/ and edit)
Project config read by every task-flow agent.

## Commands
- typecheck: `npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json`
- lint (changed files only, no --fix): `npx eslint <files>`
- format check: `npx prettier --check <files>`
- test: `yarn test --no-coverage`
- build: `yarn build`
- codegen: `npx prisma generate` (when prisma/schema.prisma changes)

## Conventions / extra review checklist
- NestJS module layout: controllers/services/dtos/constants
- Permission checks go through src/common/permission-condition
- Entity changes must write audit via entity-audit
- Error messages are i18n keys in src/languages

## Test targets (stage 6, BE)
- local: http://localhost:3000, DB from .env.docker
- test/uat: <url>, test accounts: <role -> user/password reference, never real secrets here>

## FE URLs (stage 6, FE)
- web: <url>

## Never
- prod anything; running `yarn lint` (auto-fixes whole tree); touching .env*
